{"tt1169742":"Watashi... namida, agechatta kara","tt1172465":"Watashi... nani ga shitai no...","tt1206640":"Anata ga suki na no wa watashi janai","tt1206641":"Chanto itte, koko ni kaite","tt1206642":"Dô natta? Konaida no hanashi","tt1206643":"Hai, pachipachi tte shite","tt1206644":"Kimi no namida o","tt1206645":"Naka naka tobenai ne...","tt1206646":"Nani mo mitenai watashi no hitomi kara","tt1206647":"O-sekkai na otoko no ko tte baka mitai","tt1206648":"Sore wa... nan no jôdan?","tt1206649":"Yuki ga futte inai machi","tt1206650":"Zenbu chanto suru kara"}